<h2>What Baik is</h2>
<p>Baik is a dua card deck. Each card carries an Arabic text, a transliteration, a meaning in English or Malay, and the source it is taken from.</p>

<div class="note">
  <p style="margin:0"><strong>Baik presents texts with their sources. It does not issue religious rulings.</strong> Every card names where its text comes from so you can check it. For questions of fiqh, or about how and when a dua should be used, ask a qualified scholar. We do not hold ourselves out as a religious authority.</p>
</div>

